{
  "an3.60:0.1": "Aṅguttara Nikāya 3.60 ",
  "an3.60:0.2": "6. Brāhmaṇavagga ",
  "an3.60:0.3": "Saṅgāravasutta ",
  "an3.60:1.1": "Atha kho saṅgāravo brāhmaṇo yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavatā saddhiṁ sammodi. ",
  "an3.60:1.2": "Sammodanīyaṁ kathaṁ sāraṇīyaṁ vītisāretvā ekamantaṁ nisīdi. Ekamantaṁ nisinno kho saṅgāravo brāhmaṇo bhagavantaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "an3.60:1.3": "“mayamassu, bho gotama, brāhmaṇā nāma. ",
  "an3.60:1.4": "Yaññaṁ yajāmapi yajāpemapi. ",
  "an3.60:1.5": "Tatra, bho gotama, yo ceva yajati yo ca yajāpeti sabbe te anekasārīrikaṁ puññappaṭipadaṁ paṭipannā honti, yadidaṁ yaññādhikaraṇaṁ. ",
  "an3.60:1.6": "Yo panāyaṁ, bho gotama, yassa vā tassa vā kulā agārasmā anagāriyaṁ pabbajito ekamattānaṁ dameti, ekamattānaṁ sameti, ekamattānaṁ parinibbāpeti, evamassāyaṁ ekasārīrikaṁ puññappaṭipadaṁ paṭipanno hoti, yadidaṁ pabbajjādhikaraṇan”ti. ",
  "an3.60:2.1": "“Tena hi, brāhmaṇa, taññevettha paṭipucchissāmi. Yathā te khameyya tathā naṁ byākareyyāsi. ",
  "an3.60:2.2": "Taṁ kiṁ maññasi, brāhmaṇa, ",
  "an3.60:2.3": "idha tathāgato loke uppajjati arahaṁ sammāsambuddho vijjācaraṇasampanno sugato lokavidū anuttaro purisadammasārathi satthā devamanussānaṁ buddho bhagavā. ",
  "an3.60:2.4": "So evamāha: ",
  "an3.60:2.5": "‘ethāyaṁ maggo ayaṁ paṭipadā yathāpaṭipanno ahaṁ anuttaraṁ brahmacariyogadhaṁ s